            "review_title": "Review at L'apero Hanoi",
            "review_text": "Michael J\nHanoi, Vietnam26 contributions\n0\nA quiet place to talk\nApr 2018 • Friends\nTucked away in a West Lake neighborhood, L'aparo has become one of my favorite places to meet friends. A glass of wine from walls of choices, a comfortable chair to relax in, and, most important, quiet! This little wine bar doesn't push the boundaries of noise over conversation. A friend of mine and I have been visiting this place almost weekly for a few months. We come here for the ambiance and wine to catch up with each other's lives without distractions. If you just need a quiet place to talk, read, write this is the place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 29, 2018",
